         "step": 1,
         "text": "Write the difference quotient: \\( \\lim_{h \\to 0} \\frac{f(-1 + h) - f(-1)}{h} \\), with \\( f(-1 + h) = - 2 h^{3} + 6 h^{2} - 12 h + 4 \\) and \\( f(-1) = 4 \\).",
